{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:07 2026-07-07 HKT</p>\n\n<p>天文台於今晨（7日）5時30分發出黃色暴雨警告，受大雨影響，新界北部包括元朗八鄉及錦田、上水、打鼓嶺一帶出現水浸。在打鼓嶺李屋村，所見入村的村路嚴重水浸，村民涉水而行，水深高至小腿位，相當狼狽。途經的車輛亦被淹浸幾近半個車輪，行駛時都小心翼翼，避免死火。</p>\n<p>現場消息稱，由於村路水浸，私家車司機都不敢駕車入村，只有重型車輛可以勉強涉水而行。至早上10時許，渠務署派員到場處理，清理淤塞渠口疏導水浸。</p>\n<img alt=\"打鼓嶺李屋村一帶出現水浸。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/979c3559c7ba38a51331ccc93956ae85/2026-07/1_1_3.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"村路受阻。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d2cb7fe51ee19a36f6a7f0a3b9d6800/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_28_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6dc3a9258134b2974844b8151577d76b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_31.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"重型車輛涉水而行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e58d05385c9c571d1a22e418ec0c4c19/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水深至小腿位置，途人為之卻步。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50ac6c664d88f4c6cc68c5bfef6bc152/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_30_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65b7355c84847f9a8b8e571db8c3f1dd/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_31_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"車輛小心翼翼行駛避免死火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ddf37527d825f63231a76cf5630b7aa/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e197aa0e42494e98c206d27a0d725444/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85cd1cffa1a6e9b1ca08871ea0ddc593/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d443be8d70fd07abbaa7ee9f857423fb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03ede57a95bfcd12f7c93f09440610c6/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_19_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4111b242f105e4cfac46f29fab1b8bf/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2cc768fc2dd08a176d74594422973c1d/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_34_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6cc739ae0e35be810220c3ee96a79f90/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_38.jpeg\"/>\n<p>另外在沙頭角五洲路，有村民表示今晨大雨期間，曾經水浸超過一呎高，惟至早上10時許，水浸情況已退卻。</p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17ee2738641c05859a290431edb5d0b0/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/636cfe0b87be93674c8b88b45b1a3fc0/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82a7ad32ead9827196f2003f3e5c3045/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_35_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be20c73c465176a5ce20f028cdada1a0/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b38d5806375b7c3b3503bd048a772794/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_36.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-07T03:38:24.089520+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}